{"table": "born", "slug": "EleutherAI--pythia-70m/L4/N216-positive", "step": 143000, "explanation": "This pole fires retrospectively when the current token realizes a complement, argument, or possessive slot projected by an earlier head: a licensed preposition after verbs/nouns (from after varied/quantified, at after rate, From after a heading), for after an induction statement P(n), a possessive (his/'s) or the noun it determines (point) inside an in/his phrase, the '(' opening a def function's parameter list, or a LaTeX/code completion (_{ after lim, Deg completing minDeg, cos/sim completing backslash commands). It stays quiet on the same surface token when the licensing head is absent (and tearDown() or told...from) or when the slot holds an unlicensed alternative (when/near/With/wild)."}
